== the brokers ==
the MQTT, AMQP and NATS stand-ins listen on the loopback
the AMQP stand-in will restart at the third publish to the exchange alerts

== the registry, identities minted by a seeded generator ==
fridge-07  fed9112b-eb30-4e0b-8155-d54d094f631f  mqtt devices/fridge-07/up  cbor senml
press-2    8740328e-a21e-4f12-a13d-b240a50a8ca8  amqp plant/line1.press-2.vibration  protobuf plant.Vibration
tracker-3  35a7b02b-ba94-47dc-833c-22e88e0e956e  nats fleet.tracker-3.position  msgpack
wx-1       18897650-a764-4346-b6c4-2dd6ee7916b4  serial bench  nmea xdr
wx-1 speaks on a pseudo-terminal at 4800 baud, its other side the hub's port bench

== the hub ==
the hub serves its feed and metrics on the loopback, linked to MQTT, AMQP and NATS, its gateway reading bench
rule cold-chain: mqtt:devices/+/up when temperature > 8 to amqp:alerts/coldchain.{device}
rule vibration-high: amqp:plant/line1.# when vibration_rms > 4.5 to mqtt:plant/alarms/{device}
rule battery-low: nats:fleet.> when battery < 20 to amqp:alerts/battery.{device}
rule weather: serial:* to mqtt:weather/{device}
every reading is re-published as JSON to nats:iothub.readings.{device}
the historian subscribes to iothub.readings.> on NATS
the pager reads its durable queue oncall.alerts on AMQP, bound to alerts by coldchain.# and battery.#
the panel subscribes to plant/alarms/# and weather/# on MQTT
the dashboard opens the hub's feed, a WebSocket

== fridge-07: SenML in CBOR over MQTT ==
fridge-07 sends a pack of 70 bytes: temp 4.5 Cel, hum 61 %RH
dashboard: fridge-07 (mqtt, cbor) at 08:59:58: temperature 4.5 Cel, humidity 61 %RH
historian keeps the reading as the hub re-publishes it, on iothub.readings.fridge-07 {"device":"fridge-07","id":"fed9112b-eb30-4e0b-8155-d54d094f631f","source":"mqtt","encoding":"cbor","taken":"2026-11-22T08:59:58Z","received":"2026-11-22T09:00:00Z","size":70,"values":[{"quantity":"temperature","value":4.5,"unit":"Cel"},{"quantity":"humidity","value":61,"unit":"%RH"}]}
fridge-07 sends a pack of 76 bytes: temp 9.2 Cel, hum 63 %RH, above the cold chain's 8
dashboard: fridge-07 (mqtt, cbor) at 08:59:59: temperature 9.2 Cel, humidity 63 %RH
dashboard: ! cold-chain: fridge-07 to amqp:alerts/coldchain.fridge-07
historian: iothub.readings.fridge-07: fridge-07 temperature 9.2 Cel, humidity 63 %RH
pager: alerts/coldchain.fridge-07: fridge-07 temperature 9.2 Cel, humidity 63 %RH

== press-2: Protocol Buffers over AMQP ==
press-2 publishes a plant.Vibration of 35 bytes, confirmed by the broker: rms 2.1 mm/s
dashboard: press-2 (amqp, protobuf) at 09:00:00: vibration_rms 2.1 mm/s, vibration_peak 0.4 g
historian: iothub.readings.press-2: press-2 vibration_rms 2.1 mm/s, vibration_peak 0.4 g
press-2 publishes a plant.Vibration of 35 bytes: rms 6.8 mm/s, past the limit of 4.5
dashboard: press-2 (amqp, protobuf) at 09:00:01: vibration_rms 6.8 mm/s, vibration_peak 1.9 g
dashboard: ! vibration-high: press-2 to mqtt:plant/alarms/press-2
historian: iothub.readings.press-2: press-2 vibration_rms 6.8 mm/s, vibration_peak 1.9 g
panel: plant/alarms/press-2: press-2 vibration_rms 6.8 mm/s, vibration_peak 1.9 g

== tracker-3: MessagePack over NATS ==
tracker-3 sends a fix of 50 bytes: 45.0703, 7.6869 at 42.5 km/h, battery 64 %
dashboard: tracker-3 (nats, msgpack) at 09:00:02: latitude 45.0703 deg, longitude 7.6869 deg, speed 42.5 km/h, battery 64 %
historian: iothub.readings.tracker-3: tracker-3 latitude 45.0703 deg, longitude 7.6869 deg, speed 42.5 km/h, battery 64 %
tracker-3 sends a fix of 50 bytes: parked, battery 15 %
dashboard: tracker-3 (nats, msgpack) at 09:00:03: latitude 45.0712 deg, longitude 7.6901 deg, speed 0 km/h, battery 15 %
dashboard: ! battery-low: tracker-3 to amqp:alerts/battery.tracker-3
historian: iothub.readings.tracker-3: tracker-3 latitude 45.0712 deg, longitude 7.6901 deg, speed 0 km/h, battery 15 %
pager: alerts/battery.tracker-3: tracker-3 latitude 45.0712 deg, longitude 7.6901 deg, speed 0 km/h, battery 15 %

== wx-1: NMEA 0183 on a serial line ==
wx-1 sends $WIXDR,C,21.5,C,AIR,H,48.2,P,RH,P,1.0132,B,BARO*13
dashboard: wx-1 (serial, nmea) at 09:00:06: air_temperature 21.5 Cel, humidity 48.2 %RH, pressure 1.0132 bar
dashboard: ! weather: wx-1 to mqtt:weather/wx-1
historian: iothub.readings.wx-1: wx-1 air_temperature 21.5 Cel, humidity 48.2 %RH, pressure 1.0132 bar
panel: weather/wx-1: wx-1 air_temperature 21.5 Cel, humidity 48.2 %RH, pressure 1.0132 bar
wx-1 sends $WIXDR,C,21.6,C,AIR,H,48.2,P,RH,P,1.0132,B,BARO*13, a digit changed on the line
dashboard: ! refused: wx-1: the sentence sums to *10, not its checksum *13

== what the hub refuses ==
fridge-07 sends a pack cut to 69 of its 76 bytes
dashboard: ! refused: fridge-07: no CBOR: byte 68: 3 items of 1 bytes or more where 0 bytes remain
ghost-1, which nobody registered, sends a pack on its own uplink
dashboard: ! unregistered: no device is registered at mqtt devices/ghost-1/up

== the AMQP broker restarts ==
fridge-07 sends temp 10.4 Cel; the alert it raises is the broker's third publish to alerts, where it restarts
dashboard: fridge-07 (mqtt, cbor) at 09:00:07: temperature 10.4 Cel, humidity 64 %RH
dashboard: ! amqp: lost: 320 CONNECTION_FORCED - broker forced connection closure with reason 'shutdown'; next attempt in 54 ms
dashboard: ! cold-chain: fridge-07 held for amqp, 1 waiting
dashboard: ! amqp: attempt 1 refused (permission); next attempt in 118 ms
dashboard: ! amqp: attempt 2 refused (permission); next attempt in 151 ms
dashboard: ! amqp: up again after 3 attempts; held publishes sent: 1
historian: iothub.readings.fridge-07: fridge-07 temperature 10.4 Cel, humidity 64 %RH
the pager and the press connect again, as every client of a restarted broker does
pager: alerts/coldchain.fridge-07: fridge-07 temperature 10.4 Cel, humidity 64 %RH
press-2 publishes rms 3.0 mm/s; the hub reads it from its durable queue again
dashboard: press-2 (amqp, protobuf) at 09:00:08: vibration_rms 3 mm/s, vibration_peak 0.6 g
historian: iothub.readings.press-2: press-2 vibration_rms 3 mm/s, vibration_peak 0.6 g

